  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening mediation to deal with crime affected contexts and conflicts</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The objective of this action is to strengthen the ability of international, national and local actors to design and implement effective peace mediation interventions in crime-affected conflict contexts across the globe. This will be achieved by developing and disseminating tools, knowledge, and guidance for peacemakers operating in such contexts.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
